            "to": 2,
            "link": "After sitting in the seat, the next safety measure is to engage the emergency or parking brake to prevent the tractor from moving while starting."
          },
          {
            "from": 2,
            "to": 3,
            "link": "With the parking brake engaged, the next step is to set the transmission to neutral and insert the key into the ignition to prepare for starting the engine."
          },
